			"notes": "# ChristCraft 26.2 is now a Fabric Mod\n\nChristCraft is no longer just a datapack+resourcepack bundled as a mod, this version is an actual compiled Fabric mod for Minecraft 26.2, using Mixins to change parts of world generation that a datapack can't change.\n\n### New: Dungeons don't generate zombie or skeleton spawners anymore.\nThis version changes the dungeon's mob choice:\n\nZombie slot → now spawns a random pick of Enderman, Vindicator, or Hoglin\nSkeleton slot → now spawns a random pick of Pillager or Blaze\nSpider slot is unchanged\n\n### New: Swamp huts no longer generate a witch\nThe hardcoded witch that spawns inside every swamp hut is now replaced with a Pillager (no crossbow, may be changed)\n\n### New: Trial chambers are more varied\nIn older versions, the spawner pools only ever produced spiders or cave spiders. This version adds variety, mixed alongside spiders/cave spiders:\n\n**Melee pool (husk/spider/zombie spawners):** + Enderman, Vindicator, Hoglin\n**Small melee pool (baby zombie/cave spider spawners):** + Vex, Endermite\n**Ranged & slow ranged pools (poison skeleton/skeleton/stray spawners, includes Bogged):** + Pillager, Blaze\n**Breeze, Silverfish, and Slime pools are unchanged**\n\n### Carried over unchanged from the datapack versions:\nnoskellytraps: skeleton horse trap prevention\nnozombify: piglin/hoglin zombification immunity (also closes the zoglin and zombified_piglin biome-removal gaps)\nrecipeadder: custom recipes\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/fellow-11/ChristCraft/compare/1.2.2...1.3.0"
		},
